   - **Wrestling & Tag Teams:**
     - *Terry Gene Bollea:* Better known as **Hulk Hogan**. His iconic WWF/WCW tag team alongside "Macho Man" Randy Savage (managed by Miss Elizabeth) was **The Mega Powers**. (He was also in "The Mega-Maniacs" with Brutus Beefcake).
   - **Film Industry & Shared Nationalities:**
     - *Aram Avakian & Wilfred Lucas:* Share **American** nationality. Aram Avakian (1926–1987) was an Armenian-American film director/editor (*Jazz on a Summer's Day*, *End of the Road*). Wilfred Lucas (1871–1940) was a Canadian-born American actor, director, and screenwriter.

